# Decisions (ADRs)

Accepted and superseded hard-to-reverse decisions live here as one Markdown file per decision (`NNNN-slug.md`, Nygard shape: Title, Status, Context, Decision, Consequences). ADRs are immutable once accepted — supersede with a new numbered ADR linking the old one, never rewrite history.

Start from `0000-template.md`. Only architecturally significant choices get ADRs (structure, non-functional characteristics, dependencies, interfaces, construction techniques) — not a changelog, not commit messages.
